Local modifications: exports map repointed from the upstream intx-src condition to direct TypeScript source resolution (types/default -> ./src/...); dist references removed. Upstream test files are not vendored (they import the unvendored @intx/inference-testing and @intx/test-harness test packages). CL-6396: sidecar-events.ts carries an optional childRunId on the agent.event frame so the hub can close the matching occurrence row. CL-7505: credential-push.ts threads an optional servingRefresh hook into resolveInstanceModelSources, so an expiring oauth_token credential refreshes in place before the push delivers its material. OAuth loopback login: sidecar-handler.ts hosts the loopback login flow (OAuthLoginFinalOutcome/Gate/RequestOutcome, DEFAULT_OAUTH_LOGIN_TIMEOUT_MS; index.ts and ws/index.ts re-export the types). CL-7508: sidecar-handler.ts settles the login caller promise as an error when a terminal outcome arrives before the started acknowledgement, instead of hanging until the whole-login timeout. corbitsdev/workbench#709: session-service.ts fans every top-level prepared-deploy step out through stageWorkflowStep (pure preparedStepStageArgs maps one step address via resolveStepAddress and agent id via deriveStepAgentId); workflow-allocation-service.ts rehydrates both from the frozen launch spec (preparedDeployContent fails closed without a string systemPrompt). Upstream now threads deployContent/toolPackagePins natively; the address/id mapping and the fail-closed narrowing stay local. Retired at earlier pins (prose trimmed at this re-vendor): the terminal-anchor pack acceptance (ownsWorkflowRunRepo), anchorAddressForPackSource, decideTerminalRunFlip, the PersistFrozenApprovalFn wire_projection stamp, the encodeToolName/MALFORMED_TOOL_NAME gate (and the @intx/inference dependency it needed, dropped), the readCommittedWorkflowRunTerminalStatus backfill, and the registerSignalCorrelation kind check.
